cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "presidio-recognizers-ca-in: Checksum-validated recognizers and a synthetic benchmark for Canadian clinical de-identification"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Karthik
    alias: thisiskarthikeyan
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/thisiskarthikeyan/pii-detector"
abstract: >-
  Checksum-validated Microsoft Presidio recognizers for Canadian health and
  government identifiers (SIN, provincial health cards, postal codes, street
  addresses), a framework-neutral scan API, and a reproducible synthetic
  clinical-text benchmark with evaluation harness. Indian identifiers are
  included as experimental.
keywords:
  - de-identification
  - PII
  - PHI
  - clinical NLP
  - Presidio
  - Canada
